<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan bus crash kills 20.</title>
<headline>Pakistan bus crash kills 20.</headline>
<dateline>ISLAMABAD 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A bus fell from a mountain road into a ravine in the Swat area in northwestern Pakistan on Monday, killing 20 people, the state radio said.</p>
<p>The official APP news agency reported that the accident appeared to have been caused by brake failure. Further details were not immediately available.</p>
